{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Weapons|C$utblade}}

The {{PAGENAME}} deals 135 base damage. Armor Penetration 10%. This power comes at a cost, as the sword increases attack cooldowns by 20%.


The {{PAGENAME}} must be equipped in both hand slots and counts as both a cutting tool and an edged weapon.


==How to Acquire==

First you need to wield a [[smithy's hammer]] in one hand. Then right click an [[anvil]].

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{\frac{_{q}Steel + _{q}Hardened Leather}{2} *  9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Strength *Smithing}</math>

* Damage scales with strength and weapon quality using the following formula: <math>Damage = 135*\sqrt{\sqrt{Strength*{q}Sword}/10}</math>.

